      "pClass": "productdescription",
      "pText": "Paper Boat scales up the folded paper boat every child has made into a play station for ages 5 to 12. The hull, in Baby Blue and Cherry Red, carries a blue slide, a net crawl tunnel and a climbing net, and a telescope lets young pirates keep watch. Children climb aboard, crawl through the tunnel and slide back to the ground, so play keeps moving in a loop. It takes up to 15 children within a safe play area of 22'4\" x 19'7\". The skills it builds include imagination, coordination, observation and pretend play. We give a 3-year warranty on galvanised pipe, roto-moulded parts, composite laminates and play rope. Send us your site photos for a layout drawing."
